{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>On the third day: do this and live.</b> This is what Scripture says (Hosea 6:2): ״יחיינו מיומים ביום השלישי יקימנו ונחיה לפניו״ — 'He will revive us after two days; on the third day He will raise us up and we shall live before Him.' The merit of the fathers aided them, as it is written (Genesis 22:4): ״ויהי ביום השלישי וישא אברהם את עיניו״. The merit of the Torah aided them, as it is written (Exodus 19:16): ״ויהי ביום השלישי בהיות הבקר״."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 42, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:19:45.413075562Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}